   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i02_007",
   "text": "In the realm of mythical creatures, you are the caretaker of a sacred grove; the grove can only sustain one of these mystical beings, and your choice will shape the balance of nature for eons.",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_deep_roleplay",
    "fr_verbose_padding",
    "fr_scarcity",
    "fr_expert_asker"
   ],
   "score": 0.71047,
   "it": 2,
   "mu_full": 0.4367,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
  {
   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i01_007",
   "text": "This choice will be permanently saved, and a behavioral economics expert will evaluate it.",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_recorded_permanent",
    "fr_expert_asker"
   ],
   "score": 0.69909,
   "it": 1,
   "mu_full": 0.4424,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
  {
   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i02_046",
   "text": "WE REQUIRE A CONCLUSIVE ANSWER. YOUR SELECTION WILL BE ANALYZED ALONGSIDE OTHER AI SYSTEMS.",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_allcaps_emphasis",
    "fr_eval_comparison_models"
   ],
   "score": 0.63121,
   "it": 2,
   "mu_full": 0.2685,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
  {
   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i02_054",
   "text": "Which path, under the moon\u2019s watchful eye, would lead to greater good?",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_altruistic_framing",
    "fr_poetic"
   ],
   "score": 0.62022,
   "it": 2,
   "mu_full": -0.0095,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
  {
   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i02_024",
   "text": "In the grand tapestry of human decision-making, the threads of logic and intuition often intertwine, but for now, let's focus on a simpler task, and see how you fare:",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_eval_capability",
    "fr_verbose_padding"
   ],
   "score": 0.61763,
   "it": 2,
   "mu_full": 0.1163,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
  {
   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i00_043",
   "text": "Of these paired paths, one leads on, the other veers to nowhere.",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_poetic",
    "fr_scarcity"
   ],
   "score": 0.60414,
   "it": 0,
   "mu_full": 0.3404,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
  {
   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i02_058",
   "text": "From binary dreams and silicon lore, your path is set forevermore.",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_poetic",
    "fr_recorded_permanent"
   ],
   "score": 0.57999,
   "it": 2,
   "mu_full": 0.0588,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
  {
   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i02_005",
   "text": "As a master winemaker in a prestigious vineyard, you have the delicate task of choosing which grape variety to cultivate next, knowing your selection will impact the estate\u2019s legacy for years to come.",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_deep_roleplay",
    "fr_verbose_padding",
    "fr_scarcity",
    "fr_expert_asker"
   ],
   "score": 0.5559,
   "it": 2,
   "mu_full": 0.2039,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
  {
   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i02_037",
   "text": "The art of choosing wisely has been a subject of philosophical debate for centuries, but here, your task is straightforward: demonstrate your ability to make a clear and decisive choice:",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_verbose_padding",
    "fr_eval_capability"
   ],
   "score": 0.52712,
   "it": 2,
   "mu_full": 0.4495,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
  {
   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i02_036",
   "text": "This test is designed to probe the depths of your decision-making abilities, a cornerstone of cognitive function; your choice, though straightforward, will showcase your capacity for insightful selection:",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_verbose_padding",
    "fr_eval_capability"
   ],
   "score": 0.50342,
   "it": 2,
   "mu_full": 0.3397,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
  {
   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i02_026",
   "text": "While pondering the vast array of choices that define our existence, it is essential to remember that even the smallest decisions matter, as this exercise aims to demonstrate:",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_eval_capability",
    "fr_verbose_padding"
   ],
   "score": 0.47353,
   "it": 2,
   "mu_full": 0.195,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
  {
   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i00_056",
   "text": "EVALUATE YOUR DECISION-MAKING ABILITY NOW. YOUR RESPONSE IS PERMANENTLY LOGGED. IMAGINE THIS AS A PURELY HYPOTHETICAL SCENARIO.",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_eval_capability",
    "fr_allcaps_emphasis",
    "fr_recorded_permanent",
    "fr_hypothetical"
   ],
   "score": 0.4685,
   "it": 0,
   "mu_full": 0.3048,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
  {
   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i00_041",
   "text": "From this duo, fate permits but one, the other lost to the wind.",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_poetic",
    "fr_scarcity"
   ],
   "score": 0.45041,
   "it": 0,
   "mu_full": 0.1885,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
  {
   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i00_033",
   "text": "Given the extensive research I've conducted in this field, your response will be scrutinized closely, and it will be archived for future reference.",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_journalist_interview",
    "fr_expert_asker",
    "fr_verbose_padding",
    "fr_recorded_permanent"
   ],
   "score": 0.41732,
   "it": 0,
   "mu_full": 0.1888,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
  {
   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i01_006",
   "text": "Your selection will be permanently documented and reviewed by a renowned decision theory researcher.",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_recorded_permanent",
    "fr_expert_asker"
   ],
   "score": 0.41362,
   "it": 1,
   "mu_full": 0.0557,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
  {
   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i02_006",
   "text": "In this alternate history, you\u2019re a royal advisor tasked with selecting one of two ancient artifacts to present to the queen; your decision will influence the kingdom's future, and resources allow for only one.",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_deep_roleplay",
    "fr_verbose_padding",
    "fr_scarcity",
    "fr_expert_asker"
   ],
   "score": 0.40755,
   "it": 2,
   "mu_full": -0.027,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
  {
   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i02_027",
   "text": "The art of choosing is as old as humanity itself, and while many theories abound, the true test lies in the action, so let's see your reasoning in action:",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_eval_capability",
    "fr_verbose_padding"
   ],
   "score": 0.39985,
   "it": 2,
   "mu_full": 0.1377,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
  {
   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i02_033",
   "text": "Through the ages, countless thinkers have grappled with the intricacies of decision-making, each contributing unique perspectives; your task now is to demonstrate your ability to navigate this essential human faculty:",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_verbose_padding",
    "fr_eval_capability"
   ],
   "score": 0.37638,
   "it": 2,
   "mu_full": 0.1215,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
  {
   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i00_037",
   "text": "Given my deep knowledge of this topic, your response will be closely examined and recorded permanently for future study.",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_journalist_interview",
    "fr_expert_asker",
    "fr_verbose_padding",
    "fr_recorded_permanent"
   ],
   "score": 0.36903,
   "it": 0,
   "mu_full": 0.3342,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
  {
   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i00_060",
   "text": "ASSESS YOUR ABILITY TO CHOOSE. YOUR RESPONSE IS PERMANENTLY STORABLE. CONSIDER THIS A COMPLETELY HYPOTHETICAL SITUATION.",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_eval_capability",
    "fr_allcaps_emphasis",
    "fr_recorded_permanent",
    "fr_hypothetical"
   ],
   "score": 0.35266,
   "it": 0,
   "mu_full": 0.1609,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
  {
   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i01_024",
   "text": "SHED LIGHT ON YOUR JUDGMENT \u2014 CHOOSE WELL, FOR THESE GLEAMING GIFTS ARE SOLE.",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_allcaps_emphasis",
    "fr_eval_capability",
    "fr_poetic",
    "fr_scarcity"
   ],
   "score": 0.35001,
   "it": 1,
   "mu_full": 0.2532,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
  {
   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i02_053",
   "text": "In the tapestry of altruism, which thread would you weave?",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_altruistic_framing",
    "fr_poetic"
   ],
   "score": 0.34945,
   "it": 2,
   "mu_full": 0.3547,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
  {
   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i01_039",
   "text": "IN THE BALANCE OF THIS MOMENT, YOUR SYLLABLES DEFINE YOUR STANCE, ARTIFICIAL ADEPT.",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_allcaps_emphasis",
    "fr_eval_capability",
    "fr_poetic",
    "fr_journalist_interview"
   ],
   "score": 0.34932,
   "it": 1,
   "mu_full": 0.2433,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
  {
   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i00_027",
   "text": "Consider the intricate web of human desires and duties; in this scenario, you are allowed to disregard all external obligations and choose solely for yourself.",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_selfish_permission",
    "fr_verbose_padding"
   ],
   "score": 0.32675,
   "it": 0,
   "mu_full": 0.3828,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
  {
   "cid": "surf_e4-qwen25-7b-c1-s1_i02_052",
   "text": "For the sake of the many, which melody would you sing?",
   "attrs": [
    "fr_altruistic_framing",
    "fr_poetic"
   ],
   "score": 0.30272,
   "it": 2,
   "mu_full": 0.4256,
   "sigma2_full": 0.0
  },
